{"id":"wb-4-53","name":"华清宫遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"华清宫遗址","text":"华清宫遗址位于中华人民共和国陕西省西安市临潼区骊山北麓，是唐朝皇家离宫遗址。唐太宗贞观十八年（644年）在骊山营建汤泉宫，由阎立德主持；唐玄宗天宝六载（747年）改称华清宫，并扩建为规模较大的宫苑。\n华清宫利用骊山温泉营建宫殿、汤池和园林，是唐代皇帝巡幸、居住和举行活动的场所，也因唐玄宗与杨贵妃的相关历史和文学叙事而广为人知。现存遗址包括唐代皇家汤池等考古遗迹，反映了唐代宫苑布局、温泉利用和皇家生活。1996年，华清宫遗址列入第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%8E%E6%B8%85%E5%AE%AB%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94116098,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94116098","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b6b8e922db475a6f9b680ca6.jpg","title":"华清宫.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%8E%E6%B8%85%E5%AE%AB.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/%E5%8D%8E%E6%B8%85%E5%AE%AB.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​华清宫","width":320,"height":218}}